message: "If you use this repository, please cite it."
title: 'workspace-program: representational and causal studies for "Held but not heeded"'
abstract: >-
  Representational (Study 2) and causal (Study 3) arms of a three-study preregistered
  program on whether a language model's verbal acknowledgment that a diagnostic category
  is invented is causally connected to its diagnostic behavior. Using a pre-fitted
  verbalizable-workspace lens on Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct, the fictional-status representation
  is shown to be held during diagnostic generation yet behaviorally inert. Includes the
  manuscript, three tagged preregistrations, run data, and a provenance log. The
  behavioral arm (Study 1) is in the sibling repository reification-gradient.
type: software
